Package: phyloatlas
Type: Package
Title: Load Trees from the Phylo-Species Atlas
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Francisco", "Richter", email = "richtf@usi.ch", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Convenience functions to fetch phylogenetic trees and metadata
    from the Phylo-Species Atlas
    (<https://github.com/franciscorichter/phylo-species-atlas>) directly
    from R. Provides a single entry point to load any of the standardized
    trees with species labels resolved from the shared dictionary, plus
    helpers to list available trees and inspect their provenance.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/franciscorichter/phylo-species-atlas
BugReports: https://github.com/franciscorichter/phylo-species-atlas/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports:
    ape,
    utils
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
